# ── YouCam API (Perfect Corp) ────────────────────────────────
# The engine behind OneDress. Get a key at:
#   https://yce.makeupar.com/api-console/en/api-keys/
# Redeem the 1,000-unit hackathon code, then paste the sk- key below.
# Used server-side only (never exposed to the browser).
YOUCAM_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here

# Optional — defaults to the value below if unset.
# YOUCAM_BASE_HOST=https://yce-api-01.makeupar.com

# Optional secret key (not required for the documented s2s endpoints).
# YOUCAM_SECRET_KEY=your-secret-here

# ── Notes ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# For local dev you may instead keep credentials outside the repo at
#   ~/.config/youcam/credentials.env   (chmod 600)
# lib/youcam/env.ts reads real env vars first, then falls back to that file.
# In production (Vercel), set YOUCAM_API_KEY in the project's env settings.
